-AhemSpaceLigature
-
-Synthetic font to test whether ligatures including a space glyph are rendered correctly.
-Derived from http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS/Test/Fonts/Ahem/
-
-The font contains the following common ligatures ("liga"):
-A space A -> C
-a space a -> C
-Where a,A is a square block and C is a U shaped polygon.
-
-License Information:
-
-http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS/Test/Fonts/Ahem/COPYING
